1
00:00:00,150 --> 00:00:01,391
This man got lost in

2
00:00:01,391 --> 00:00:02,710
the Sahara Desert,

3
00:00:02,710 --> 00:00:03,680
for nine days.

4
00:00:04,160 --> 00:00:05,470
And he says he survived,

5
00:00:05,470 --> 00:00:06,580
by drinking bat blood.

6
00:00:07,030 --> 00:00:10,280
In 1994, Italian police officer

7
00:00:10,280 --> 00:00:12,345
Mauro Prosperi was running the

8
00:00:12,345 --> 00:00:13,670
Marathon des Sables.

9
00:00:14,220 --> 00:00:15,839
A six-day race across the

10
00:00:15,839 --> 00:00:16,840
Moroccan desert.

11
00:00:17,240 --> 00:00:18,810
On day four,

12
00:00:19,250 --> 00:00:20,460
a sandstorm hit.

13
00:00:20,460 --> 00:00:20,530
It raged for hours.

14
00:00:20,980 --> 00:00:21,823
When it cleared,

15
00:00:21,823 --> 00:00:22,521
he was alone.

16
00:00:22,521 --> 00:00:23,870
He had run the wrong way.

17
00:00:24,270 --> 00:00:26,009
He had only a little water left.

18
00:00:26,009 --> 00:00:26,940
Soon, it was gone.

19
00:00:27,390 --> 00:00:28,490
Then, he found an

20
00:00:28,490 --> 00:00:29,533
abandoned shrine.

21
00:00:29,533 --> 00:00:30,807
Inside, the roof was

22
00:00:30,807 --> 00:00:32,120
covered in bats.

23
00:00:32,120 --> 00:00:32,940
He caught them,

24
00:00:32,940 --> 00:00:33,991
and drank their blood

25
00:00:33,991 --> 00:00:34,670
to stay alive.

26
00:00:35,170 --> 00:00:36,080
Then he kept walking.

27
00:00:36,620 --> 00:00:38,030
Only at dawn and dusk,

28
00:00:38,030 --> 00:00:38,840
to save his strength.

29
00:00:39,340 --> 00:00:40,160
On the ninth day,

30
00:00:40,500 --> 00:00:42,450
he stumbled into a camp of nomads.

31
00:00:42,900 --> 00:00:43,940
He was in Algeria.

32
00:00:44,390 --> 00:00:45,495
Almost three hundred

33
00:00:45,495 --> 00:00:46,650
kilometers off course.

34
00:00:47,050 --> 00:00:49,130
He had lost around sixteen kilos,

35
00:00:49,500 --> 00:00:50,950
and it took him months to recover.

36
00:00:51,550 --> 00:00:52,656
And four years later,

37
00:00:52,656 --> 00:00:53,354
he went back,

38
00:00:53,354 --> 00:00:54,580
and ran the race again.
